Run.Description Twisted bilayer graphene at 1.08 degrees: flat bands with the plane-wave reduction
Run.Prefix generate

Run.TypeOfSystem TwistedBilayerBasedOnMoireCell
Structure.MoireCellParameters 31 30 30 31
Structure.SuperCell 1
Stack.TwoLayers .true.
Stack.TwoLayersZ1 18.325
Stack.TwoLayersZ2 21.675
Structure.InterlayerDistance 3.35
Structure.CellHeight 40.0

Intralayer.F2G2Model .true.
TB.NeighLevels 5
TB.Hopping 3.5
TB.OnSiteC 0.4914

Interlayer.TypeOfBL Koshino
Interlayer.KoshinoSR .true.
Interlayer.RenormalizeCoupling .true.
Interlayer.CouplingFactor 1.008     # rigid lattice; 0.895 is the value used with relaxed structures

Kubo.Calc .false.
Diag.Calc .true.
Calculate.Bands .true.
MagField.Integer 0

# Plane-wave reduction around one graphene valley (Diag.N_G = number of shells of moire
# reciprocal vectors). Diag.MoireAngle = orientation of the first layer in the frame of the cell.
TAPW.Use .true.
TAPW.aG 2.46
Diag.MoireAngle 0.0
Diag.N_G 8
Diag.UseKprimeValley .false.

Bands.NumPoints 20
&begin Bands.Path 4
2/3  1/3  0.0   # K
0.0  0.0  0.0   # Gamma
1/2  1/2  0.0   # M
1/3  2/3  0.0   # K': the other corner of the moire zone
&end Bands.Path

Neigh.fastNNnotsquare .true.
Neigh.LayerNeighbors 400
Neigh.LayerDistFactor 4.0
Output.WriteDataFiles .false.
